// ONE SUPPLY BEHIND A CHECK VALVE, TOO WEAK TO LIFT WATER TO ITS SPRINKLER 10 M UP.
// THE VALVE SHUTS: LOSS OF SUPPLY, NOT A PASS AND NOT A SOLVER FAILURE.
// EXPECT: 4 NONCOMPLIANT
UNITS LENGTH M
UNITS ELEVATION M
UNITS SIZE MM
UNITS PRESSURE KPA
UNITS FLOW LPM
UNITS KFACTOR LPM/KPA
METHOD HW
USE BORE 120
WATER W 0 50
NRV W 0
NODE J1 0
SPRINKLER S1 10 60 80
PIPE A1 W J1 10 100
PIPE R1 J1 S1 10 65
